        {
          "path": "_m/g/f/h/6/glencoe-wk/glencoe-lochan-scotland.jpg",
          "filename": "Glencoe Lochan - Scotland.jpg",
          "caption": "The weather was very mixed at Glencoe, where I have returned from a few days holiday. It rained every night but almost every evening brought a great sunset. \nThis was the first night in the area. A visit to the Three sisters, then here, at Glencoe Lochan. \nI arrived at the Lochan to be greeted with perfect reflections and a great sky, too. The problem with these locations at this time of year are midges. There was a countless number at this spot alone and have actually had to clone some out as they were stuck to the filters.. \nAll in all it was a good holiday and I have a few more shots to post. \n\nThanks for looking.",
          "alt": "The weather was very mixed at Glencoe, where I have returned from a few days holiday. It rained every night but almost every evening brought a great sunset. \nThis was the first night in the area. A visit to the Three sisters, then here, at Glencoe Lochan. \nI arrived at the Lochan to be greeted with perfect reflections and a great sky, too. The problem with these locations at this time of year are midges. There was a countless number at this spot alone and have actually had to clone some out as they were stuck to the filters.. \nAll in all it was a good holiday and I have a few more shots to post. \n\nThanks for looking.",
          "width": 4928,
          "height": 3264,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Jonathan Combe from Scotland",
          "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Glencoe_Lochan_-_Scotland.jpg",
          "sourceType": "commons-category",
          "sourceArticleId": "glencoe-wk",
          "sourceGeohash4": "gfh6",
